# Factorial manifests are byte-reproducibility artifacts: a test regenerates them and
# compares. core.autocrlf=true is set in this environment and there is no other
# .gitattributes, so a fresh checkout would rewrite them to CRLF and the regenerated
# LF output would no longer match byte-for-byte. Pin them to LF.
data/d1_factorial/*.json text eol=lf
